<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\風呂.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>My head hurt a little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was because feelings strong enough to cry over were welling up in me, and yet no tears came.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Crying would surely clear it up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But the tears didn't come.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So my head hurt a little.<PG>
Soaking in the tub, I let out a big sigh.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In place of the tears that wouldn't come, I meant to breathe out whatever was in my heart.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
One more time, a big sigh―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\サード\夏菜風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"You're sighing like that. Does the bath feel that good?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah... it feels good."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>, did I look like I was in paradise, pure paradise?<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, let's rinse all the bad stuff right off in the bath!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
What is this...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\誰もいない校舎で.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan's</STYLE> words are the kind of line I usually say to my senpai.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm being comforted by a little kid like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> is a little like me...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, have you ever had trouble because of your eye color?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"My eye color?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Hmm... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">yep!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So it is true... Am I going to run into discrimination like that from now on, too?<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"What did you have trouble with?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"They always make me do the roles with the longest lines!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　They say I suit them the best!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
Lines?
{PAUSE ""}
　Roles?
{PAUSE ""}
　Suit them?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I get the feeling we're not quite talking about the same thing...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\紅葉のダンス.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\夏菜演劇.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"At last year's school play, I was a princess who had to cry at the end!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　It was super hard... I had to stay late at school every day..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ah, she means the play.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan's</STYLE> looks, she probably gets recommended for standout roles, like a princess or a young lady.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We really weren't talking about the same thing!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\サード\夏菜風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"How about your friends? Do you get along?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I get along with everybody! There are only 10 kids in my grade, though!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　When </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mama</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was a kid there were over 100, I guess. Is this that 'aging society' thing?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With so few kids, maybe nobody gets discriminated against over eye color.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then again, in <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan's mom's</STYLE> day, who knows.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, hey, what's </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> like normally?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">buys me food sometimes."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh! So she's really doing the senpai thing!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　But, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, if you eat that much, isn't it hard on </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> allowance?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"The first time she treated me, she called me shorty, so I got a little worked up and wiped out </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Senpai's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> whole allowance in one day."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ahahaha! Poooor </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　How much did you eat that time?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um, that time it was... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">a steak set, </STYLE>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE追加\hand-drum01.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\サード\ステーキ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "730" "50" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">a pork-cutlet stew set, </STYLE>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE追加\hand-drum01.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\サード\かつ煮.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "730" "300" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">a negitoro bowl, </STYLE>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE追加\hand-drum01.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\サード\ネギトロ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "480" "50" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">a tempura-and-soba set, </STYLE>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE追加\hand-drum01.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム4" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\サード\天ざる.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "480" "300" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">oh, all of those, two sets each. </STYLE>
{CREATECG "アイテム5" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\サード\天ざる.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "20" "300" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム6" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\サード\ネギトロ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "20" "50" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム7" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\サード\かつ煮.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "250" "300" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム8" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\サード\ステーキ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "250" "50" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE追加\hand-drum01.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Plus a chocolate cake and </STYLE>
{CREATECG "アイテム9" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\サード\ケーキ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "100" "200" "200" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE追加\hand-drum01.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">a fruit parfait... </STYLE>
{CREATECG "アイテム10" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\サード\パフェ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "500" "100" "200" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE追加\hand-drum01.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">and was that it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\cannon1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1,アイテム2,アイテム3,アイテム4,アイテム5,アイテム6,アイテム7,アイテム8,アイテム9,アイテム10" "29" "1000" "5" "0" "" "1"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"What do you mean, 'was that it'... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... poor thing..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"But </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> are really close!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Who else are you close to?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Who else I'm close to...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was <STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now <STYLE ID="5">Senpai</STYLE> isn't here anymore.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... That's the person you said died the other day..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Code_of_Honor_#2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah... her name's </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">She died in the Motoki-cho case."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"So that's what happened... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Mm..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> looked at my face, worried.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"And yet, I can't cry. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I loved her so much, she was so precious to me... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Ever since I got these eyes, I've been off."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">just don't cry... You don't have to force yourself to cry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">That senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> would be sad if you cried, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So instead of crying, I think it's better to pray for her to be happy in heaven."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Also, I told you </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">my sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> used to have one green eye, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Maybe if both your eyes turn the same color, like </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">my sister's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you'll feel better, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Why did her eye color change?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I don't really know... but she stayed somewhere in this settlement for a little while, I heard. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">And then it got better, supposedly?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Somewhere... where?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Dunno... somewhere I don't know about. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It was right when I was born, it sounds like, so I never got the full story."</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\風呂.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
After she stayed somewhere for a few days, her eye color changed...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If what <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> says is true, there must have been something that triggered the change in eye color.<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> have had odd eyes since you were born, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Is there anyone else like that in this settlement?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Nope, nobody. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Sometimes people got born with blue eyes, like </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mama</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I guess, but there's nobody with just one eye a different color."</STYLE><PG>
Congenital eye color is basically caused by either heredity or mutation.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If both sisters are odd-eyed, it's most likely hereditary.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan's mother</STYLE> apparently has two blue eyes, and <STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san</STYLE> has dark eyes to begin with.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If they aren't <STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san's</STYLE> biological children, things would seem to add up, but in a settlement like this, and two children at that...<PG>
No, wait. From here on, I should think it through with myself included.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, I need to find what <STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>, and I have in common.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The trigger for getting green eyes...<PG>
In my case, it was probably because I was splashed with <STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai's</STYLE> blood.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A chance for <STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE> or <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> to be splashed with <STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai's</STYLE> blood... 
{PAUSE ""}
there shouldn't have been one.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE> is older than <STYLE ID="5">Senpai</STYLE>, so the timing makes it impossible too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or maybe <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE> have intuition like mine, too?<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, can you ever sense danger?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Danger...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
　<STYLE ID="1">That's something </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mama</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> has!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mama</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> can tell when something dangerous is about to happen!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could it be the <STYLE ID="3">mother</STYLE> who has it...!?<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Ghost.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey! Has </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">your mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> ever been badly hurt!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Something where she bled a lot!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Nope, I don't think so..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right, the two of them were <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="・・・・・">born with</STYLE> odd eyes, so that has nothing to do with it...<PG>
I'd been thinking that if <STYLE ID="3">she</STYLE> had been badly hurt at some point, the sisters might have had a chance to touch her blood.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If they were odd-eyed from birth, then their eye color changed without any contact with blood.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
No... 
{PAUSE ""}
it's possible...
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
